  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Living Sacrifice",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore, I urge you, brothers and sisters, in view of God's mercy, to offer your bodies as a living sacrifice, holy and pleasing to God—this is your true and proper worship.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not conform to the pattern of this world, but be transformed by the renewing of your mind. Then you will be able to test and approve what God's will is—his good, pleasing and perfect will.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Humble Service in the Body of Christ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For by the grace given me I say to every one of you: Do not think of yourself more highly than you ought, but rather think of yourself with sober judgment, in accordance with the faith God has distributed to each of you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For just as each of us has one body with many members, and these members do not all have the same function,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so in Christ we, though many, form one body, and each member belongs to all the others.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We have different gifts, according to the grace given to each of us. If your gift is prophesying, then prophesy in accordance with your",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "faith;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "if it is serving, then serve; if it is teaching, then teach;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "if it is to encourage, then give encouragement; if it is giving, then give generously; if it is to lead,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "do it diligently; if it is to show mercy, do it cheerfully.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Love in Action",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Love must be sincere. Hate what is evil; cling to what is good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be devoted to one another in love. Honor one another above yourselves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never be lacking in zeal, but keep your spiritual fervor, serving the Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be joyful in hope, patient in affliction, faithful in prayer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Share with the Lord's people who are in need. Practice hospitality.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bless those who persecute you; bless and do not curse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rejoice with those who rejoice; mourn with those who mourn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Live in harmony with one another. Do not be proud, but be willing to associate with people of low position.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not be conceited.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not repay anyone evil for evil. Be careful to do what is right in the eyes of everyone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it is possible, as far as it depends on you, live at peace with everyone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not take revenge, my dear friends, but leave room for God's wrath, for it is written: \"It is mine to avenge; I will repay,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "says the Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the contrary:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 12:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"If your enemy is hungry, feed him;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 12:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "if he is thirsty, give him something to drink.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 12:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "In doing this, you will heap burning coals on his head.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not be overcome by evil, but overcome evil with good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ROM.13",
    "number": "13",
    "bookId": "ROM"
  },
